==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. If you were to have trouble with this stage, treat it like a harder version of [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]]. Treasures from Empire of Cats can make this stage much more manageable for early-game players.

